meta { name: Refusal — cross-tenant must 404, type: http, seq: 4 }

get { url: {{adminBase}}/articles/{{otherTenantArticleId}}, body: none, auth: none }

headers { Cookie: {{sessionCookie}} }

docs {
  An article id belonging to the OTHER tenant, requested with this tenant's
  session.

  Expect 404 — never 403, and never the article. A 403 would confirm the
  resource exists, which leaks across the isolation boundary just as surely as
  returning the body would. See core-engine/docs/tenant-isolation.md.

  Set otherTenantArticleId by listing articles while signed in as the other
  tenant's author (devin-hartley).
}
